<Track #add-existential-rules version="1" apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "completed" goal = "在 cozo-om 层以「Skolem 改写 + 宿主驱动循环 + 违例检测查询」实现存在规则：声明式定义持久化、集合语义违例检测、幂等 Skolem chase 物化，并与 schema 版本化/alias 集成；viz governance 页新增完整性检查演示" description = "新增 om_existential_rule_def 与 defineExistentialRule/listExistentialRules/checkExistentialRules/applyExistentialRules 四个 API；v1 head 仅支持 exists:{rel,toType}；纳入 schema snapshot/diff/rollback；/governance 新增完整性检查子 tab" commit_mode = "manual" created_at = "2026-06-10T07:49:38Z" updated_at = "2026-06-10T09:45:19Z" } (
  <Ports { scope = "track" } [
    <MaterialBundle { role = "input" name = "behavior-deltas" domain = "behavior" path = "vfs://./behavior_deltas/" }>
    <MaterialBundle { role = "output" name = "behavior" domain = "codument" path = "vfs://@/codument/behaviors/" }>
  ]>
  <TaskSpace #space_add_existential_rules { name = "add-existential-rules" } (
    <Description ?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPN4>
    新增 om_existential_rule_def 与 defineExistentialRule/listExistentialRules/checkExistentialRules/applyExistentialRules 四个 API；v1 head 仅支持 exists:{rel,toType}；纳入 schema snapshot/diff/rollback；/governance 新增完整性检查子 tab
    </?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPN4>
    <SubNodes [
      <TaskGroup #P1 { name = "规则定义与持久化" status = "DONE" order = 0 } (
        <Description ?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPN5>
        创建 om_existential_rule_def；实现 defineExistentialRule / listExistentialRules，含 spec 校验与 alias canonicalize（OM-024）
        </?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPN5>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T1.1" name = "om_existential_rule_def 建表与 define/list API" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPN6>
            initSchema 幂等创建 om_existential_rule_def{rule_name =&gt; spec(Json), mode, message, enabled}；实现 defineExistentialRule（upsert 语义）与 listExistentialRules。
            </?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPN6>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T1.1-AC1" checked = true } ?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPN7>
              initSchema 重复调用不破坏既有规则定义
              </?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPN7>
              <Criterion { id = "T1.1-AC2" checked = true } ?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPN8>
              define 后 listExistentialRules 返回持久化的规则，重定义为 upsert
              </?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPN8>
            ]>
            <SubNodes [
              <Task { id = "T1.1.1" name = "编写测试：建表幂等 + define/list/upsert（om-existential-define.test.js）" status = "DONE" order = 0 }>
              <Task { id = "T1.1.2" name = "实现：建表 + defineExistentialRule/listExistentialRules + d.ts" status = "DONE" order = 1 }>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T1.2" name = "spec 校验与 alias canonicalize" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPN9>
            define 时校验 forEach.type / exists.rel / exists.toType 存在性与 where 合法性；引用经 resolveType/resolveRel/resolveAttr 解析为 canonical 名称后持久化；非法 spec 报错不写入。
            </?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPN9>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T1.2-AC1" checked = true } ?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPNA>
              缺失 exists.rel/toType 或引用不存在的类型/关系时返回错误
              </?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPNA>
              <Criterion { id = "T1.2-AC2" checked = true } ?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPNB>
              以 alias 名称定义的规则持久化为 canonical 名称
              </?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPNB>
            ]>
            <SubNodes [
              <Task { id = "T1.2.1" name = "编写测试：非法 spec 拒绝 + alias canonicalize" status = "DONE" order = 0 }>
              <Task { id = "T1.2.2" name = "实现：spec 校验与 canonicalize" status = "DONE" order = 1 }>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P2 { name = "违例检测 checkExistentialRules" status = "DONE" order = 1 } (
        <Description ?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPNC>
        集合语义违例检测：多态 body/head 匹配、where 属性条件、@NOW 与 asOf 时间语义（OM-025）
        </?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPNC>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T2.1" name = "违例查询编译与基础检测" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPND>
            每条 enabled 规则编译为一次集合查询：body 实例集（type 后代闭包）减 head 满足集（om_edge@NOW 且对端在 toType 闭包内）；返回 [{rule, entityId, message}]；支持 options.rules 过滤与 disabled 跳过。
            </?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPND>
