              </?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPNE>
              <Criterion { id = "T2.1-AC2" checked = true } ?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPNF>
              body 与 head 的子类型实例均正确匹配（多态）
              </?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPNF>
            ]>
            <SubNodes [
              <Task { id = "T2.1.1" name = "编写测试：基础违例 + 多态匹配（om-existential-check.test.js）" status = "DONE" order = 0 }>
              <Task { id = "T2.1.2" name = "实现：checkExistentialRules 查询编译" status = "DONE" order = 1 }>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T2.2" name = "where 条件与 temporal 语义" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPNG>
            where 条件按 om_property 当前快照过滤 body；边存在性按 @NOW 判定（retract 视为不存在）；options.asOf 支持历史时点检测。
            </?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPNG>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T2.2-AC1" checked = true } ?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPNH>
