          <Task { id = "T3.2" name = "驱动循环：不动点、幂等、上限诊断" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPNQ>
            循环至本轮无新建（reachedFixpoint:true）或 maxIterations（默认 10，返回 reachedFixpoint:false + 未收敛规则诊断）；重跑幂等；人工补录的实体不被物化；options.validTime 透传到全部写入。
            </?01M1W0XR6MPEKMAGYZ2F63MPNQ>
            <Acceptance [
